## 5. How to check the connection

```sql
DESC USER KAFKA_USER;                        -- RSA_PUBLIC_KEY_FP should have a value
SELECT COUNT(*) FROM ATMOSYNC_DB.RAW.IOT_SENSOR_RAW;
```

